# The build context is this directory, and on a development machine it holds
# things the image has no use for. A clone from GitHub has none of them -- these
# are all gitignored -- so this file only matters for a local `docker build` and
# for the rsynced copy on the Home Assistant box.
#
# panel/src is NOT excluded: the Dockerfile does not COPY it, so it costs a
# little context transfer and nothing else, and excluding it would make the
# add-on directory on the box a worse thing to read when something is wrong.
panel/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
